    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/1/71078.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 9,
    "turn_text": "That is true. And currently, you are one of 17 physicians in Congress. So with that kind of perspective that you have of the health field, and especially now as we're battling COVID-19, and what areas are you seeing health priorities really shifting?",
