    "turn_text": "Right. It's almost like the pandemic really opened up people's eyes into what is capable with technology and the importance of things like supply chain and some of the innovations with telehealth, et cetera. So, you know, you're in an interesting position because as you've mentioned during our February digital health event, regulations can both help and hurt the healthcare industry. So can you go into that a little bit?",
