      },
      {
        "text": "Secure and safe transmission of health-related data across networks is essential, especially in telehealth.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Protecting sensitive health data from theft or unauthorized access is crucial.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "No single person present has all the answers regarding this matter.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "A recent article in the local newspaper reported the first attributable death linked to ransomware hacking.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The victim's data was seized by ransomware, contributing to her death due to the resulting injury.",
