      },
      {
        "text": "Trust in digital systems increases when they support urgent human needs like saving lives.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "Public awareness and concern about cyber threats to healthcare are growing and legitimate.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "Family members are responsible for ensuring their loved ones' safety through technological preparedness.",
